  "body": "The request of the maintainer (relayed 2026-11-17, as #2392 records it): \"have it setup a bunch of examples.. for debugging..\", with the screenshots on a separate images branch.\n\n## What\n\n`cargo xtask catalog --screenshots` (`xtask/src/catalog_media.rs`) makes one PNG for each case. Its output is not published: upstream has no `catalog-screenshots` branch.\n\n- Render one blank image and one image for each operation of a case, as `docs/images/first-part-*.png` does for the guide.\n- Publish the images to one images-only branch at stable paths (`catalog/<family>/<case>/<name>.png`).\n- Link the images from the README of the case and from the docs.\n\nRecommended branch: `catalog-screenshots`. The `screenshots` branch holds review evidence below issue and PR numbers.\n\nThe command needs a GPU or a software adapter. It is not a gate step.\n\nDone means: the images branch holds the images of each case at stable paths. No PNG is in the product tree. The README of the seed case `2d/first-part` shows its images. A second run without a source change gives the same paths.\n\nPart of #2392\n",
